ABOUT_CULTURE_VAL2_DESC	{"en": "Since its establishment, the company has always adhered to the business principle of people-oriented and integrity, gathering industry elites, doing its best to solve worries for partners. Based in China, the company provides all-round solutions to global customers, enabling the enterprise to always maintain its core competitiveness in the fierce changes of market competition, achieving fast and stable development of the enterprise.", "id": "Sejak didirikan, perusahaan selalu menganut prinsip bisnis yang berorientasi pada orang dan integritas, mengumpulkan elit industri, melakukan yang terbaik untuk memecahkan kekhawatiran bagi mitra. Berbasis di China, perusahaan menyediakan solusi menyeluruh kepada pelanggan global, memungkinkan perusahaan untuk selalu mempertahankan daya saing intinya di tengah persaingan pasar yang ketat, mencapai perkembangan perusahaan yang cepat dan stabil.", "vi": "Từ khi thành lập, công ty luôn tuân thủ nguyên tắc kinh doanh lấy con người làm gốc và chính trực, quy tụ các anh tài trong ngành, nỗ lực hết mình để giải quyết những mối lo ngại cho các đối tác. Có trụ sở tại Trung Quốc, công ty cung cấp các giải pháp toàn diện cho khách hàng toàn cầu, giúp doanh nghiệp luôn duy trì năng lực cạnh tranh cốt lõi trong bối cảnh thị trường cạnh tranh khốc liệt, đạt được sự phát triển nhanh chóng và ổn định của doanh nghiệp.", "zh": "公司自成立以来，始终坚持以人才为本、诚信立业的经营原则，荟萃业界精英，尽最大努力为合作伙伴解决后顾之忧，公司立足国内，向全球客户提供全方位的解决方案，使企业能在激烈的市场竞争变化中始终保持拥有核心竞争力，实现企业快速、稳定地发展。"}	2026-05-18 00:54:12.058	2026-05-18 01:00:07.559
ABOUT_CERT_ISO	{"en": "ISO", "zh": "ISO9001"}	2026-05-18 02:03:32.368	2026-05-18 02:15:59.571
ABOUT_QUALITY_SUBTITLE	{"en": "Comprehensive Three-in-One Quality Control System", "zh": "三位一体的全面品质管控体系"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.97	2026-05-18 02:21:29.97
ABOUT_QUALITY_IQC_TITLE	{"en": "IQC Incoming Quality Control", "zh": "IQC Incoming Quality Control"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.975	2026-05-18 02:21:29.975
ABOUT_QUALITY_IQC_LABEL	{"en": "Incoming Quality Control", "zh": "来料质量控制 (进料检验)"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.979	2026-05-18 02:21:29.979
ABOUT_QUALITY_IQC_DESC	{"en": "Incoming material is the source of quality management; by controlling the source well, subsequent production will be relatively easier. First, we need to understand where incoming parts are used in the product, how each part affects the product, and most importantly, the customer's requirements for the parts. Second, we must select appropriate suppliers based on the functions and processing techniques of the parts to ensure quality and save costs. Simultaneously, we communicate key quality control points to suppliers, striving to align supplier control points and inspection methods with our company's IQC methods and instruments, and compile inspection specifications.", "zh": "进料是品质管理的源头，把源头控制好，后面的生产也会相对轻松。首先需要了解进料的零部件用于产品的何处，每种零件会对产品产生何种影响，重要的是客户对零部件的要求。第二要根据零部件的功能及加工的工艺选择合适的供应商，保证零部件的质量、节约成本。同时要将零部件的品质管控要点知会供应商，尽力做到供应商管控的要点及检验的方法与公司IQC检验的方法与仪器一致，编制检验规范。"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.983	2026-05-18 02:21:29.983
ABOUT_QUALITY_IPQC_TITLE	{"en": "IPQC In-process Quality Control", "zh": "IPQC In-process Quality Control"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.987	2026-05-18 02:21:29.987
