ABOUT_QUALITY_IPQC_DESC	{"en": "In-process quality management is relatively more difficult than the other two components because of its broad scope. Therefore, first-piece inspection, routing inspection, and final-run inspection must be treated with utmost care and diligence. Furthermore, employees' self-inspection is also crucial; it is essential to fully realize that \\"quality is manufactured, not inspected.\\" The verification of the first-piece quality should involve inspecting appearance, dimensions, performance, drawing versions, models, and master samples, and must be confirmed by both assembly and engineering. Process routing inspections should determine frequency and items based on part structure and machine stability. Final-run inspection effectively prevents the outflow of defective items, and sampling ratios must be logically selected based on production batch and structure.", "zh": "制程品质管理相对其它两块是较难的，因为它涉及范围较广，所以首检、巡检、尾检需认真谨慎对待；其次员工的自检也非常重要，要充分认识到“品质是制造出来的，不是检验出来的”。首件产品品质的确认，应从外观、尺寸、性能、图纸的版本和型号、样板等进行检测，组装端与工程端确认。过程的巡检，应根据零件结构与机台的稳定性确定巡检的频率和检验的项目。尾检(终检)能有效遏制不良品的流出，抽样比例应同产品批量及结构合理选择。"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.995	2026-05-18 02:21:29.995
ABOUT_QUALITY_OQA_TITLE	{"en": "OQA Outgoing Quality Control", "zh": "OQA Outgoing Quality Control"}	2026-05-18 02:21:29.999	2026-05-18 02:21:29.999
ABOUT_QUALITY_OQA_LABEL	{"en": "Outgoing Quality Control", "zh": "出货质量保证 (出厂检验)"}	2026-05-18 02:21:30.003	2026-05-18 02:21:30.003
ABOUT_QUALITY_OQA_DESC	{"en": "Every product requires re-inspection of packaging, labeling, quantity, weight, and model before shipment. Simultaneously, a small sample of products will be drawn to inspect appearance, dimensions, and performance, minimizing the risk of defective items reaching the market.", "zh": "每款产品，在出货前都需要对包装、标识、数量、重量、型号等进行复检，同时会抽取少量的产品进行外观、尺寸、性能进行检验，降低不良品外流的机率。"}	2026-05-18 02:21:30.007	2026-05-18 02:21:30.007
