about_page_content	{"heroTitle":{"en":"Innovation & Excellence","zh":"专业 · 专注 · 创新"},"heroSubtitle":{"en":"Global Integrated Computing Solution Provider","zh":"全球领先的集成计算解决方案提供商"},"introTitle":{"en":"About Heovose","zh":"关于 Heovose"},"introText":{"en":"Founded in 2012, Heovose is a high-tech enterprise specializing in the R&D, manufacturing, and global distribution of All-in-One computers, Mini PCs, and smart display solutions.\\nWith a commitment to innovation and quality, we empower businesses and individuals worldwide with cutting-edge technology and reliable hardware.","zh":"Heovose 成立于 2012 年，是一家专注于一体机电脑、迷你 PC 及智能显示解决方案研发、制造与全球销售的高新技术企业。\\n我们致力于通过技术创新与卓越品质，为全球企业与个人用户提供前沿的计算动力与可靠的硬件支撑。"},"cultureItems":[{"title":"Brand Concept","desc":"Excellence in Every Detail","detail":"We believe that true quality lies in the meticulous attention to every component and process."},{"title":"Corporate Mission","desc":"Empowering the Digital Future","detail":"Providing accessible, powerful, and reliable computing tools for the global digital transformation."},{"title":"Development Concept","desc":"Win-Win Cooperation","detail":"Building lasting partnerships through mutual trust and sustainable growth with our global clients."}],"labItems":[{"id":"vibration","name":"Vibration Test Lab","desc":"Simulating harsh transportation and operation environments to ensure structural integrity."},{"id":"temp","name":"Climatic Chamber","desc":"Testing hardware reliability under extreme temperature (-40°C to 80°C) and humidity."},{"id":"salt","name":"Salt Spray Test","desc":"Evaluating corrosion resistance for maritime and industrial applications."}]}
